<http://tool4boxology.org/Boxology/064a0c1a-f768-4453-a3d6-4a347facde4f> a beam:Element,
        beam:System ;
    rdfs:label "Diagram" ;
    beam:context """Dicoding is a learning platform, providing students with AI-based explanations. 
Explanations can be generated in two ways:
a) Explain-on-highlight in course material
b) Chat-based question-answering

Not depicted in diagram:
- observability/tracing using LangFuse
- sanitization of user message, retrieved material, course information
- vector representation caching
- session summarization?
- fallback in case of unavailable model
- unzipping course materials, file format specific pre-processing, chunking""" ;
    beam:description """The explanation system is based on RAG.
Course materials are indexed and later retrieved using hybrid retrieval. The LLM generates the explanations based on retrieved documents, followed by guardrails.

Open Questions:
- Is the workflow the same for explain-on-highlight and question-answering?
- What happens if guardrail detects issue?
- Quality assurance of course material (content-wise and technical) as potential risk?
""" ;
    beam:hasProcess <http://tool4boxology.org/Component/node_1784869989408>,
        <http://tool4boxology.org/Component/node_1784870052005>,
        <http://tool4boxology.org/Component/node_1784870083270>,
