<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/064a0c1a-f768-4453-a3d6-4a347facde4f/node_1784888288944> a beam:Note ;
    rdfs:label "Note: Other Risks + Controls" ;
    beam:description """Risks:
- abuse/rate-limit (including shared campus IP)
- weak API auth (non-constant-time, without lockout)
- path traversal in memory store
- leak raw error messages without security headers/global exception handlers
- dependency has not been audited

Risk Controls:
- output filter fail-closed
- rate limit
- double fallback (factory + service level)
- Langfuse tracing
- schema validation
- isolation of “explain(ation) endpoint”
""" .

